  "note": [
    "The Rec Corridor's fabric (DR-106), cut from the one Kalamontee layout in scripts/fabric-kalamontee.mjs -- regenerate from there, do not hand-edit. REC-CORRIDOR.metadata.json v5: 12 x 3.4 x 10, the eye at the middle, built wall by wall for its chamfered south-west corner.",
    "Five openings: east the 3.2 x 3 mouth onto the Mess Corridor; west the 3.2 x 2.8 mouth onto the Rec Area; north and south the dorm portals at x 0.5, 3.2 x 2.5; south-west a 2.4 x 2.8 mouth centred on the chamfer at [-4.65, 3.65].",
    "Seen through them: down the axis east, the Mess Corridor, the Dorm Corridor and the Long Hall; west, the Rec Area's tables and shelf; north and south, Dorm B and Dorm A with the DR-107 bunk banks and their wash rooms bright at the far ends; south-west, the Plain Hall's branch, 13 m long, ending on the Plain Hall's west wall with no daylight in sight. No painted states: nothing this eye sees changes (the Conference door, the Storage West door and the Courtyard are all out of sight)."
